  "st2.t": "Open your squad", "st2.p": "Open your FC 27 squad file; assets are read live from the installed game. You can work with several files at once.",
  "st3.t": "Edit in the hubs", "st3.p": "Leagues, teams, players, kits, stadiums and faces — each in its own hub, with a live 3D preview.",
  "st4.t": "Save and play", "st4.p": "A backup is made when you save. Faces, kits and tifos land in a mod package or ready for FIFA Editor Tool.",
  "plans.no": "06 · Editions", "plans.title": "Lite, Standard, Ultimate",
  "plans.lead": "Lite is free. For Standard and Ultimate you pay through Buy Me a Coffee, then create a code request and your key arrives by e-mail.",
