  "req.no": "07 · Code request", "req.title": "Get your license key",
  "req.lead": "Fill in the form; once your payment is confirmed, your key is sent to your e-mail. Lite needs no payment.",
  "rs1.t": "Choose your edition", "rs1.p": "For Standard or Ultimate, send the matching support on Buy Me a Coffee. Lite is free; skip this step.",
  "rs2.t": "Send the form", "rs2.p": "Send the request with your e-mail and (for paid editions) your Buy Me a Coffee name; keep the request number shown on screen.",
  "rs3.t": "Your key by e-mail", "rs3.p": "Once the payment is confirmed your key arrives at the same address, usually within 24 hours. Sign in to the launcher with it.",
